# card42 eMRTD personalization script - demo set (ICAO Doc 9303-11 sample).
#
# One section per LDS1 instance (EmrtdPersoExporter):
#
#   @instance <AID-hex>          start a section (default A0000002471001)
#   @doc <MRZ document number>   BAC document number
#   @dob <YYMMDD>                BAC date of birth
#   @doe <YYMMDD>                BAC date of expiry
#   @dg <n> <hex>                EF.DG<n> content (DG1 mandatory)
#   @sod <hex>                   EF.SOD content (built from the DG hashes when absent)
#   @aa <hex>                    AA private key (modLen || modulus || expLen || exponent)
#   @ca <hex>                    CA static P-256 private scalar (DGI FF03)
#   @cardsecurity <hex>          master-file EF.CardSecurity CMS SignedData (DGI FF05)
#
# The EF.SOD is signed by the DSC fixture (perso/emrtd/dsc.crt + dsc.key);
# the AA key pair is a throwaway demo key.  These keys are printed on purpose
# and MUST NEVER be used on a real card.
#
# Regenerate with `EmrtdPersoExporter -emit`.
@instance A0000002471001
@doc L898902C<
@dob 690806
@doe 940623
@can 123456
@dg 1 615B5F1F58503C55544F4552494B53534F4E3C3C414E4E413C4D415249413C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C3C4C383938393032433C3355544F3639303830363146393430363233365A45313834323236423C3C3C3C3C3130
@dg 2 
@dg 11 6B3E5C085F0E5F115F425F125F0E144552494B53534F4E3C3C414E4E413C4D415249415F110355544F5F420655544F5049415F120B2B34363830303030303030
@dg 12 6C355C085F195F265F555F565F190355544F5F260832303236303130315F550E32303236303130313132303030305F5606636172643432
@dg 14 
@dg 15 
@sod 
@aa 
@cardaccess 31283012060A04007F0007020204020102010202010C3012060A04007F00070202030201020102020101
@ca E79084DFCB875DB4EB1061A4F70F3CF5DA5B60ED678A612349DC3D60E9AFBBAC
@cardsecurity 

# LDS2 Travel Records instance: EF.CardAccess advertises PACE
# (ECDH generic mapping) and Chip Authentication (ECDH 3DES);
# @ca is the CA static P-256 private scalar (DGI FF03), @cardsecurity
# publishes the matching public key, @record appends a record.
@instance A0000002472001
@lds2 travel
@doc L898902C<
@dob 690806
@doe 940623
@cardaccess 31283012060A04007F0007020204020102010202010C3012060A04007F00070202030201020102020101
@cardsecurity 
@ca E79084DFCB875DB4EB1061A4F70F3CF5DA5B60ED678A612349DC3D60E9AFBBAC
@record 0101 5F44035553415F37083230323630313031
@record 0101 5F44034E4C445F37083230323630323135

# LDS2 Visa Records instance: EF.VisaRecords 0103.
@instance A0000002472002
@lds2 visa
@doc L898902C<
@dob 690806
@doe 940623
@record 0103 5F44034A504E5F37083230323630343031

# LDS2 Additional Biometrics instance: EF.Biometrics1 0201
# (a transparent EF, Doc 9303-10 §5.3.3).
@instance A0000002472003
@lds2 biometrics
@doc L898902C<
@dob 690806
@doe 940623
@transparent 0201 7F6108020101020203040506
